WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.202 --> 00:00:04.358
Public health spending is routinely treated as a residual state cost.

2
00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:07.302
When a government minimizes its health budget,

3
00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.510
the financial burden doesn't disappear.

4
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.294
It transfers directly to its citizens.

5
00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:13.638
Take Bangladesh.

6
00:00:13.962 --> 00:00:18.118
The national health allocation hovers at just 5% of the total budget.

7
00:00:18.506 --> 00:00:20.486
Leaving a massive funding vacuum.

8
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.278
To fill that vacuum, citizens are forced to pay directly for their care at the clinic or pharmacy.

9
00:00:26.794 --> 00:00:34.598
This direct burden, known as out-of-pocket expenditure, makes up a staggering 68% of Bangladesh's total health spending.

10
00:00:35.018 --> 00:00:37.062
That is one of the highest rates globally.

11
00:00:37.578 --> 00:00:41.414
And this strain isn't driven by rare expensive medical emergencies.

12
00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:45.734
Exactly 72% of the spending goes to basic outpatient care.

13
00:00:46.122 --> 00:00:48.838
Like everyday medicines and routine diagnostics.

14
00:00:49.322 --> 00:00:53.446
While low public health funding might look like savings on the national balance sheet,

15
00:00:53.802 --> 00:00:55.878
this relentless localized cost

16
00:00:56.298 --> 00:00:58.790
actively pushes millions into poverty every year.

17
00:00:59.146 --> 00:01:01.382
Fracturing the baseline consumer economy.

18
00:01:01.962 --> 00:01:05.382
This proves health system resilience is not a residual expense.

19
00:01:05.706 --> 00:01:07.974
It is essential economic infrastructure.

20
00:01:08.362 --> 00:01:11.206
That prevents catastrophic household financial collapse.

21
00:01:11.658 --> 00:01:15.366
When a state funds public health, it isn't just treating patients.

22
00:01:15.594 --> 00:01:19.174
It is actively protecting the foundation of its entire economy.

23
00:01:19.658 --> 00:01:22.182
Human in purpose. Systemic in method.

24
00:01:22.506 --> 00:01:23.654
Protective in outcome.
